r: #b45309; font-size: 15px;\">🤝 Your Sales Mentor</h3>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6;\">\n        <strong>Jessica Vance</strong> (VP of Sales)<br/>\n        Email: <a href=\"mailto:jessica.v@company.com\" style=\"color: #b45309;\">jessica.v@company.com</a> | Slack: <code>@jessica-vance</code>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5;\">Join our weekly Revenue Sync this <strong>Tuesday at 11:00 AM EST</strong> on Slack channel <code>#sales-announcements</code>.</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #334155; margin-top: 24px;\">Here's to crushing quota together!<br/><strong>Global Sales Leadership</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background: #f1f5f9; padding: 14px 28px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;\">\n    Employee ID: {{ $json.Employee_ID }} &bull; Department: Sales &bull; Automated Onboarding System\n  </div>\n</div>"
